I had this problem when I first started playing also.  I can't recall the
exact assign (LEVELS=Nethack: or something) but the problem is that if
you set it in the NetHack.cnf file and then use HackWB the icon Information
supercedes the config file.  You have to go into HackWB, select your game icon,
go to the pulldown menu and select Information, and put the correct assign in
THERE.

An alternative method is to check the icon info to see where it is currently
looking and then just copy all the #?.lev files to that directory.

Hope this helps.  If not, mail me and I'll look up the exact procedure.
